      "speaker": "Astra",
      "text": "Could Rohin\u2019s reported raw-child Next-Steps handshake\u2014carry unfinished work forward, then check what happened\u2014help you stop returning the questions to someone else? For 12350 \u00d7 100, what uncertainty could further thought settle, and would a small attempt provide better evidence? What thinking or doing step do you choose to perform yourself next? What observation would change that choice? What finding, its source, remaining uncertainty, and unfinished next step will you carry into the following turn?"
